OL,3,GNEWSAWolves hosts free community mental
OL,4,Ahealth training
OL,5,
OL,6,FA football club has offered free mental
OL,7,Fhealth and suicide awareness training
OL,8,Fto its local community.
OL,10,FWolverhampton Wanderers FC have invited
OL,11,Ffans and people from across the city to
OL,12,Ftake part in the session which aims to
OL,13,Fprovide practical skills on how to help
OL,14,Fsomeone who may be experiencing
OL,15,Femotional distress.
OL,17,FAs part of its 'Ow Am Ya?' campaign,
OL,18,Fthe club has teamed up with Samaritans
OL,19,Fand Wolves Foundation to offer the
OL,20,Ftraining.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
